      "role": "user",
      "content": "auto-brewery what?? i havent even had much carbs lately. but the sweet smell is definitely there. u think it’s serious? i dont really want to go to the doctor if it's just something weird in my gut or just dehydration. can i just try drinking some more Gatorade and see if it goes away by tomorrow?",
