      "content": "I understand your hesitation, but auto-brewery diarrhea syndrome can be a symptom of an underlying condition, such as small intestine bacterial overgrowth (SIBO). If left untreated, this can lead to more serious complications like malabsorption of nutrients and other health issues. While drinking more hydration like Gatorade might provide temporary relief, it's not addressing the root cause of your symptoms. If you're concerned, it's better to consult a doctor to get a proper diagnosis and guidance.",
